# OKF v0.2

The Open Knowledge Format, at one revision: the `okf/SPEC.md` commit pinned in
`docs/pinned-revision.md`, whose preamble declares **Version 0.2**.

The namespace is named for the declared version, because that is what a reader
looks for, but it is bound to the **commit**. Upstream has no tags and edits
`SPEC.md` in place, so a second commit can declare v0.2 and say something else;
`docs/pinned-revision.md` holds the SHA that settles which text this is.
-/

